# Pairs with OperatorFinal: the tenant layer is consulted before the operator layer, so a tenant verdict overrides a matched operator rule.

MODULE: TenantBeforeOperator
TARGET: OperatorFinal
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the tenant layer is consulted before the operator layer, so a tenant verdict overrides a matched operator rule

--- FIND
       THEN IF opm.matched THEN opm ELSE tenm
--- REPLACE
       THEN IF tenm.matched THEN tenm ELSE opm
--- END
